WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:07.750
A conman named Victor Lustig sold the Eiffel
Tower.

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:10.309
Twice!

00:00:10.309 --> 00:00:18.200
In the mid-1960s, Slumber Party Barbie came
with a book called "How to Lose Weight."

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.850
One of the tips was "Don't eat."

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:25.320
Nasa is developing 3D printed pizzas for astronauts.

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:31.010
Because news traveled so slow back then, slaves
in Texas didn't know they were free for more

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:37.560
than two months after Lincoln issued the Emancipation
Proclamation which declared that all slaves

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:39.530
are instantly freed.

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:43.910
The first escalator in Britain was in Harrods
in 1889.

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:48.690
The trip on the escalator was so scary for
most folks that Harrods employed an attendant

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:53.489
to stand at the top of the escalator with
brandy and smelling salts to calm down the

00:00:53.489 --> 00:00:56.180
customers after a terrifying ride.

00:00:56.180 --> 00:01:01.399
Calvin Klein's Obsession for Men is used by
researchers to attract animals to cameras

00:01:01.399 --> 00:01:03.379
in the wilderness.

00:01:03.379 --> 00:01:09.590
In 1962, The U.S. government detonated a hydrogen
bomb in space called “Starfish Prime”,

00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:13.499
that was one hundred times more powerful than
Hiroshima.

00:01:13.499 --> 00:01:17.579
In Utah, it is against the law to fish from
the back of a horse

00:01:17.579 --> 00:01:23.069
Prairie dogs have such a complex communication
system that they can accurately describe predators

00:01:23.069 --> 00:01:27.990
with their calls, they even have a specific
call for a man with a gun.

00:01:27.990 --> 00:01:32.259
Marie Curie's notebooks are still radioactive.

00:01:32.259 --> 00:01:35.479
Researchers hoping to view them must sign
a disclaimer.

00:01:35.479 --> 00:01:41.439
Sleeping through winter is hibernation, while
sleeping through summer is estivation.

00:01:41.439 --> 00:01:47.109
The Playboy bunny costume was the first service
uniform to be registered with the U.S. Patent

00:01:47.109 --> 00:01:49.060
and Trademark Office.

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:53.810
Antartica is punishingly cold but it's not
all ice and snow.

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:59.849
About 1,200 square miles of the continent
is made up of “dry valleys” where mountains

00:01:59.849 --> 00:02:02.460
and ridges keep out precipitation.

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:08.220
Right now over 70% of people who are driving
on highways are speeding.

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:12.970
Astronauts aboard the international space
station witness around fifteen sunrises and

00:02:12.970 --> 00:02:15.450
sunsets every day.

00:02:15.450 --> 00:02:24.190
After Leonardo da Vinci's death, King Francis
I of France hung the Mona Lisa in his bathroom.

